* regulator output at rest: its minimum load and capacitor hold it at 0 V
Rldo ldo_out 0 1
* mode requests: pins of the controller behind their output resistance
Vsrc pin_src 0 PWL(0 0)
Rpad_src pin_src gate_src 33
Vamp pin_amp 0 PWL(0 3.3)
Rpad_amp pin_amp gate_amp 33
* device under test at the output terminal: a capacitor behind 20 mohm with
* a current sink beside it, on a lead of 50 nH and 5 mohm
Ldut vout dut_a 50n
Rlead_dut dut_a dut 5m
Resr dut dutc 20m
Cdut dutc 0 0.0001
Iload dut 0 PWL(0 10m 5e-06 10m 5.1e-06 1)
.control
save supply vin_p vout_s vout dut sense_r3 vlead#branch
tran 20n 0.000405 0 100n
.endc
